    {
      "id": "claim_c15578e255dc487599c5a4859f1d99b2",
      "statement": "A cell that waits out the operation deadline behind the activation or capacity gate is refused with `CapacityExhausted`; the `QueuedActivation` timer is keyed by cell and generation so a later parking cannot disarm an earlier one.",
