    {
      "id": "claim_586d84c10777484dbd2a1e3d7be9cd94",
      "statement": "The shed victim is chosen from resident, idle, covered-alarm cells, preferring the isolate closest to empty (only taking an isolate's last cell returns its heap), then never-refused first, then by recency of a refused eviction, then least-recently-used with id as tiebreak.",
